CORE
environment.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Dynamic sites: 0 resolved, 1 unreachable, 1 unresolved \(2 rounds\)$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] file environment.sh line 7 .*: none: SUCCESS$
--
^warning: ignoring
shell-dynamic-site\.2
--
A value from the environment leaves the site unresolved, converted for
all names; a site after exit is unreachable, so that no name is converted.
